            "sid": "JOS 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Gershoni bea jeeda gheeda fuga Lawi geelaksa bea heeda eemeeda silach bugusta bea Manase, Golani mida Bashani sea haghweadaanyi, ea mujiineeda simng'awiisa aba siida bwar siida ea Beeshtera sea ng'eanyiida haghweadaanyi mujiinajeega ea iyeenya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak eemeeda Isakari, geataw Gishoni sea ng'eanyiida haghweadaanyi, ea Daberati sea ng'eanyiida haghweadaanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yarmuut sea ng'eanyiida haghweadaanyi, ea Enganimu sea ng'eanyiida haghweadaanyi mujiinajeega ea ang'wan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak eemeeda Asheri, Mishali sea ng'eanyiida haghweadaanyi, ea Abdoni sea ng'eanyiida haghweadaanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Helkati sea ng'eanyiida haghweadaanyi, ea Rehobu sea ng'eanyiida haghweadaanyi mujiinajeega ea ang'wan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak eemeeda Naftali, geataw Gadeshi mida jeeda Galilaya sea ng'eanyiida haghweadaanyi, ea mujiineeda simng'awiisa aba siida bwar siida, Hamot-dori sea ng'eanyiida haghweadaanyi, Gartani ea ng'eanyiidaanyi mujiinajeega ea samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 21:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mujiinajeega fuga gheeh Gershoni sean ea damasamwagu mujiinajeega sea ng'eanyiida haghweeda nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.21.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
